Portions of this project are adapted from the "Hue Lights Sync"
plugin (hue_entertainment) in the Music Assistant server project:

    Music Assistant server — https://github.com/music-assistant/server
    Copyright the Music Assistant contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The analyzer is an adapted port of that plugin's analyzer: its mode
presets and its spectrum/peak/beat rendering mechanics were carried
over and reworked for LIFX targets. The Sendspin visualizer/color
bridge structure and the virtual LIGHT player registration pattern in
the bridge and provider modules are likewise adapted from the Hue
plugin (reference revision 73c3e59). No code from the Hue plugin's
Hue-specific streaming layer (DTLS / HueStream) is used; the LIFX
output side is original.

This product uses the lifx-async library to communicate with LIFX
devices over the local network:

    lifx-async — https://github.com/Djelibeybi/lifx-async
